text FirstTimeItemShop {
	"Since this is your first time using my\n"
	"item shop system let me explain.\p"
	"I can sell you items just like the\n"
	"PokeMart. You can unlock more shops\p"
	"by obtaining gym badges. The more gym\n"
	"badges you obtain increases the list\p"
	"of shops you can access."
}

